E ExtentResidency              | ByteSpace.h | 33-38   | contract                      | -  | Where a claimed span lives, which is the only distinction the caller makes. device declares, and it differs per device, per driver and per configuration. A caller naming the vendor ordinal directly has hard-coded one machine's declaration into a claim site.
